drm/i915: Xe3 peak bandwidth point and BW buddy (7.3)

Mainline's, in 7.3, for 7.2, which lacks them. In order:

173455d429f2 drm/i915/bw: Don't memcpy() pointlessly
fd5f8a3a9209 drm/i915/bw: Streamline dg2_get_bw_info()
8965d70181d2 drm/i915/bw: Initialize num_planes sensibly for the first p
2421dec89de5 drm/i915/bw: Move 'bi_next' to tighter scope
8b58b18bf720 drn/i915/bw: s/num_points/num_qgv_points/
d8ffe49c04a9 drm/i915/bw: Move num_{qgv,psf}_points out from the plane g
9037f07dfc09 drm/i915/bw: Move psf_bw[] out from the plane group
db7a45983f23 drm/i915/bw: Move peakbw[] out from the plane group
10738a07c07b drm/i915/bw: Print derated bandwidth numbers for DG2
7c04faaee60b drm/i915/bw: Use icl_qgv_bw()
88b30ff4bc52 drm/i915/bw: Simplify the best max_data_rate search
fb8a24c0799d drm/i915/pm_demand: introduce HAS_PMDEMAND macro
490de5721672 drm/i915/display: sagv pre/post plane calls to check pmdema
6d7e5cebd077 drm/i915/bw: Extract icl_init_qgv_info()
f6d7d21db353 drm/i915/bw: extract update_sagv_status()
3c6862a39f5c drm/i915/bw: avoid replicating the update_sagv_status() cal
3d4d292970d3 drm/i915/bw: introduce the peak bandwidth threshold
662560bad9be drm/i915/bw: Fix spelling mistake "threshod" -> "threshold"
de28bb67e245 drm/i915/display: update to the BW buddy configuration

